plan-v4d (@VERSION@-@REVISION@) raspbian; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Raspberry Pi OS (Debian 12/Bookworm).
  * Custom build of OpenCV @VERSION@ with Plan-DSL and V4D visualization modules.
  * Built with Qt5, OpenGL ES, and OpenCL support.
  * Optimized for ARM (armhf/arm64) architectures.

